# Google Maps Platform API Key (NEVER hardcode secrets in source control)
#
# Quickstart — Free Zero-Billing Maps Demo Key (Prototyping Only):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card or Cloud project required).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Click to generate/reveal your Demo Key, then paste it below into your local `.env` file.
#    Note: The Demo Key has a daily quota limit and is NOT for production usage.
#
# Production Setup:
# - Create an API key at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# - Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, and Geocoding API.
# - Restrict the key by HTTP referrer / server IP and specific APIs.
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
